This project is made to look into the similarities of words from different translations of the same works to find any patterns between the word embeddings created. In order to do this, we take the embeddings after the models are trained and we find the difference between two sets of vector spaces. Take for instance, the english word adventure and the spanish translation aventure. We then do this to a different word in english and it's spanish counterpart and by doing cosine similarity between the values from these differences, we can see if a pattern emerges. We then went onto graph the vector spaces of all the words from the two models to further look for patterns that may emerge.
